OL,5,G2000 Stuart Maconie's Freak Zone
OL,6,     FStuart talks to the Pet Shop Boys
OL,7,     Fand exclusively premieres their
OL,8,     Fnew album, A Man from the Future,
OL,9,     Fwhich explores the work and legacy
OL,10,     Fof computer pioneer Alan Turing.
OL,11,G2200 Dream Time
OL,12,     FZakia leans into the autumnal
OL,13,     Fvibes with some long wistful
OL,14,     Ftracks from the likes of Vangelis
OL,15,     Fand Eddie Harris, as well as a
OL,16,     FDreambience mix from London DJ and
OL,17,     Fproducer Anja Ngozi.
OL,18,G0000 Guy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,19,     FGuy chats to Glenn Richards of
OL,20,     FAustralian band the Augie March.
OL,21,     FThey toured together 25 years ago
OL,22,     Fso it's time for a catch-up.
